Package: com.yg.uibridge
Name: UIBridge
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: AI-drivable UI automation bridge for jailbroken iOS (accessibility tree dump + HID gesture injection), the iOS counterpart of Android's uiautomator2. No screenshots required: the agent reads a structured element tree and acts on elements or coordinates.
Maintainer: YG
Author: YG
Section: System
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
